  "prefLabel": "Mec 702.03 Oil fired heating equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 702.03 “Oil fired heating equipment” means all appliances or equipment designed to burn heating oil for the purpose of providing heat or hot water in structures, including all necessary accessory apparatus such as control devices, heating oil storage systems, appliance venting, and equipment fuel supply piping.\n\nSource. #13631, eff 7-9-23",
